{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692270/extras/Movie_078-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748270362\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s Included in Reaper Hunt: Survivor Demo:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 class </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 ability</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flag Capture</strong><br>Flags scattered across the arena grant large amounts of experience when captured.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Upgrade Cards</strong><br>Choose enhancements on the fly\u2014every run feels unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692270/extras/Movie_084-ezgif.com-cut.gif?t=1748270362\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Levels and Portals</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>White</strong><br>Glittering ruins filled with deadly mechanical traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Snow</strong><br>A snowy wasteland of icy cliffs and raging blizzards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Forest</span></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> <br>Dense thickets of trees, where stealthy foes lie in wait.</span> (<strong>Available</strong> <strong>only in Full Version</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Portals</strong><br>Clearing all objectives on a level opens a portal to the next arena, with a fresh roster of enemies and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692270/extras/Movie_150-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748270362\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enemies and Bosses</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Standard Foes</strong><br>Various unit types, each with its own attack style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-Bosses</strong><br>Enhanced enemies wielding special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Bosses</strong><br>Climactic battles that demand the perfect combination of collected cards and honed skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692270/extras/Movie_080-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1748270362\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Skill Tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players earn skill points by leveling up and spend them on the following upgrades:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Critical Damage</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Critical Chance</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Max Health</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move Speed</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Health Regeneration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Damage</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>XP Amount</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>XP Radius</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cStorm Bringer\u201d Class</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hero specialized in long-range, tactical combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assault Rifle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grenade Launcher</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shotgun</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat Drones</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laser Weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Targeting Modules</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dash (Ability)</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">&quot;Wizard&quot; Class</span> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Available</strong> <strong>only in full version</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">&quot;Engineer&quot; Class</span></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Available</strong> <strong>only in full version</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progression and Rewards</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience Cases</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quests</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3692270/becc3ebee475c5cf79283cd75925a2b6363d6248.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692270?t=1748270362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692270?t=1748270362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692270/b70c58f86f6e79d48e3757d5aeb0c7715c0128e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748270362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692270/b70c58f86f6e79d48e3757d5aeb0c7715c0128e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748270362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\